      "README.md": "# KreditCallApp Flutter Migration\r\n\r\n## Toolchain\r\n- Flutter: 3.41.5+\r\n- Dart: 3.11.0+\r\n\r\n## Commands\r\n- `flutter pub get`\r\n- `flutter run --dart-define=KC_API_ENV=dev`\r\n- `flutter test`\r\n- `dart run scripts/version_guard.dart`\r\n\r\n## mTLS Setup (`client.p12` + password)\r\n- Runtime certificate source is `assets/security/client.p12` only.\r\n- `scripts/prepare_mtls_assets.dart` accepts cert input from:\r\n  - `KC_MTLS_CLIENT_P12_BASE64` (primary)\r\n  - `MTLS_CLIENT_P12_BASE64` / `mtls_client_p12_base64",
